l>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}card6\\text{-}initial\\text{-}ordinal} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCard6InitialOrdinal}_S(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}card6\\text{-}initial\\text{-}ordinal} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCard6InitialOrdinal}_S(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>In the von Neumann convention of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a>, a cardinal is exactly an initial ordinal; this atom records that representation alias without introducing a second notion.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S$ (cardinal predicate, see [[58-df-cardinal]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"In the von Neumann convention of [[58-df-cardinal]], a cardinal is exactly an initial ordinal; this atom records that representation alias without introducing a second notion.","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcCard6InitialOrdinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}card6\\text{-}initial\\text{-}ordinal} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCard6InitialOrdinal}_S(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)","display":true}],"bytes":921,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1496","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-zfc-card6-initial-ordinal.md|58-df-zfc-card6-initial-ordinal]]（batch06）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","5fb1c2241d1943d1"]}